All dictionaries are unmodified UTF-8 text files from upstream data/dictionary.
The reference s2twp.json is the unmodified upstream data/config/s2twp.json.

The native DFCN converter follows this configuration using OpenCC TextDict:
  segmentation: STPhrases
  conversion 1: STPhrases, then STCharacters as an ordered DictGroup
  conversion 2: TWPhrases
  conversion 3: TWVariants

TWPhrases is assembled in memory from TWPhrasesIT, TWPhrasesName and
TWPhrasesOther, in the same order and with the same last-key-wins behavior
as upstream data/scripts/merge.py and common.py. No generated dictionary
or preprocessing step is required.
